<title>USA: Campbell Soup Co Q1 net down after charge.</title>
<headline>Campbell Soup Co Q1 net down after charge.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							 THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>							 Oct.	    Oct.</p>
<p>						  27, 1996	 29, 1995</p>
<p> Net sales					 $2,052	  $1,990</p>
<p>  Restructuring charges			   216		 -</p>
<p> Net earnings					  88	     219</p>
<p>Per share</p>
<p>     Net earnings				   .36	     .88</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding (weighted)	246	     249</p>
<p>NOTES: After tax impact of restructuring charge is $160 million, resulting in net excluding charge of $248 million, or $1.01/shr.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
